From 5293195c4350836bc50f1d8dfe234640f7f51d46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thorvi <thorvi@mbp>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:55:26 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: Add events table and Event model

Create the events table (title, starts_at, user_id with a foreign key to
users, ON DELETE CASCADE) and the Event model with notEmpty validations
on title and starts_at, a BelongsTo user() relation and two formatting
helpers for the start date. User gains the HasMany events() relation.

Tests: EventTest covers create, find, validations, update, destroy,
where, relation and cascade; UserTest covers events() and events()->new().
