Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: Add events CRUD for authenticated users

RESTful routes inside the auth group (index, paginate, new, create,
show, edit, update, destroy), a thin EventsController that only touches
the logged user's events through User::events() (HasMany), views with
a shared _form partial (novalidate, invalid-feedback, values kept on
re-render), "Eventos" link in the navbar and three demo events in the
populate script. Events of other users respond 404.
